# Read by MSBuild for every build under this folder (dotnet build, test, publish), as if typed on the command line.
# The worker nodes a parallel build starts exit when the build ends, instead of waiting fifteen minutes for the next
# one: on the development computer (7 GB) six idle nodes held 700 MB after every build (2026-11-08). The scripts also
# run `dotnet build-server shutdown` after their builds, which ends the Roslyn compiler server, kept ten minutes otherwise.
-nodeReuse:false
